body:
@jlovejoy I'm confused by this still being called "Q Public License 1.0", but modified (apparently by someone other than Trolltech) to change the choice of law. (And also to remove the "Oslo City Court" venue requirement.)

I would tend to think of a change to choice of law being something substantive enough to warrant a different identifier.

I don't love the idea of still calling it "Q Public License" in the name or identifier. Maybe "HEVEA" License, or else "QPL-1.0-HEVEA"?

@jamesjer - would you have time to prepare the PR for the files for this license in the next few days, by any chance?!?
 :)

as per: https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md
